bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis bco:currentRecord bcoc:record-657667441ade80f7950cc6bd8f8d55e4dfe07aef0cd41ac7427ae48a9ce02413 .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis bco:definitionGenus bco:BusinessCapability .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis bco:foundationalAncestor cco:ont00000568 .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis bco:lifecycleStatus "Draft" .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis bco:sourceReference bcoc:source-12523d5f190ddcc954ccbf335a2ff64ec7e1e12da0c3a15007e1b923cb04bdba .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis bco:sourceReference bcoc:source-7fbc3e395fbf7b5de65a40d2ae8efb38bd86a1bbd43695fb0d7bf146cb9ae03a .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis bco:sourceReference bcoc:source-aa18f2be9785bc5958d0fc79b9b3d3c15742ece3e290f43d0435a829edd67a81 .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis dcterms:created "2026-10-24T12:14:15+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis prov:wasAttributedTo bcoa:claude-opus-5-5 .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis rdf:type skos:Concept .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis skos:changeNote "2026-10-24, review R6 section 3.2: generalized, and a clause dropped. The definition required the analysis to be carried out through coordinated work among the organization's members, not resting on one analyst's skill. That made the number of members doing the work part of what the capability is, which specification CD2's \"Fragility is not reclassification\" bullet denies: a capability may depend on one indispensable member and still be the organization's. Whether capabilities of this type are organizational rather than a person's Skill is asked once, at type admission (G1-T question 3), not stated as a condition on every instance. \"Realized in\" became \"realizable in\" (CD8). Every source is now marked contextual (R6 section 6.1)."@en .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis skos:changeNote "2026-10-25, review R7 section 4: \"organizations\" became \"agents\". A competitor need not be an organization: a sole trader is a person. The bearer of the capability is still an organization; only what it analyses is widened. The genus field now names the immediate genus, bco:BusinessCapability: the class the definition's text names and bcom:BusinessCapability designates. cco:ont00000568 (Organization Capability) moved to foundational_ancestor (review R7 Finding E; docs/decisions/2026-10-25-r7-genus-decision.md). Nothing is minted."@en .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis skos:definition "A business capability, inhering in an organization, that is realizable in planned acts by which that organization gathers and interprets information about the agents it competes with, or may come to compete with, to inform its own decisions."@en .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis skos:inScheme bcoc:CapabilityCatalogScheme .
bcoc:CompetitiveAnalysis skos:prefLabel "Competitive Analysis"@en .

